      ],
      "elapsedScriptedMs": 2.203199999999981,
      "answer": "# Answer\n\nEvery employer of an employee shall pay monthly to the Fund in respect of each employee contributions at the respective rates prescribed in the First Schedule. In calculating the employee's share of contribution, any fraction of a dollar which is a cent or cents shall be discarded. Total contribution payable shall be rounded to the nearest dollar.",
