      ],
      "elapsedScriptedMs": 1.3168999999999755,
      "answer": "# Answer\n\nSalary earned by an employee under a contract of service shall be paid before the expiry of the seventh day after the last day of the salary period. Payment for overtime work shall be made within 14 days after the end of the salary period.",
